复杂地质条件下城际铁路隧道施工风险分析及应对措施
Risk Analysis and Countermeasures for Intercity Railway Tunnel Construction
Under Complex Geological Conditions
王灿
(诚合瑞正风险管理咨询有限公司,北京 100000)
WANG Can
(Chenghe Ruizheng Risk Management Consulting Co. Ltd., Beijing 100000, China)
【摘 要】以凤凰南路站—马鞍山公园站盾构区间(含凤马区间盾构井)城际铁路工程为研究背景,深入研究复杂地质和周边环境
条件下的城际铁路隧道关键施工技术,根据项目基本概况以及风险分析,提出工程应对措施。 探讨了掘进参数设计的影响,在实际
掘进过程中,严格控制土仓压力控制、总推力调整、掘进速度控制、刀盘转速的调整、同步注浆控制、盾构机轴线姿态控制,确保施工
质量与安全。
【Abstract】 Taking the intercity railway project from Fenghuang South Road Station to Maanshan Park Station (including Fengma shield shaft)
as the research background, the key construction technology of intercity railway tunnel under complex geological and surrounding
environmental conditions is deeply studied, and engineering countermeasures are proposed according to the basic situation of the project and
risk analysis. The influence of the design of driving parameters is discussed. In the actual driving process, the pressure control of soil bin, the
total thrust adjustment, the driving speed control, the cutter speed adjustment, the synchronous grouting control and the axis attitude control of
shield machine are strictly controlled to ensure the construction safety and quality.
【关键词】复杂地质条件;城际铁路隧道;盾构施工;风险分析;应对措施
【Keywords】 complex geological conditions; intercity railway tunnels; shield construction;risk analysis; countermeasures
